---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Ramón Miklus, software engineer based in Italy."
>
  <h1
    class="font-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight"
  >
    About
  </h1>

  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none font-serif mt-8">
    <p>Hi, I'm Ramón. I'm a software engineer based in Italy.</p>
    <p>
      For more than ten years I've worked across web platforms, mobile apps,
      data visualisation and cloud systems, mostly in JavaScript and Python. I'm
      currently a Staff Software Engineer at Nagarro, where I provide technical
      consultancy to companies ranging from early-stage startups to the Fortune
      500.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is where I document what I learn along the way. Expect candid
      notes on engineering practices, tooling and architectural trade-offs:
      practical thoughts shaped by building systems, questioning assumptions,
      and trying to get things right.
    </p>
    <p>
      Feel free to reach out if you'd like to talk about tech, or anything else,
      at <a href="mailto:hello@ramonmiklus.com">hello@ramonmiklus.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
